  --body "$(cat <<'EOF'
## Summary
- Increase prompt-effect test timeout from 3s to 10s (CI runner latency causes race condition)
- Increase hook timeout test limit from 5s to 10s (sleep+kill overhead on slow runners)
- Add null check for `session.data` in `duplicate-pr.ts` with stderr output

## Test plan
- [ ] `bun test test/hook/execute.test.ts` passes locally
- [ ] `bun test test/session/prompt-effect.test.ts` passes locally
