  - Model tier mismatch detection (advisor)
  - Cost waste detection (high-tier model on low-tier agent)
  - Provider-tier recommendations
  - Per-provider LLM call tracking
  - Session provider tracking

#### Hook: experimental.session.compacting
- **Lines:** ~1160-1184 (25 lines)
- **Category:** State tracking
